yle="font-family:&quot;Bookman Old Style&quot;,serif"><span style="color:black">, the term “permanent establishment” shall be deemed not</span></span></span></span></i></span></span></span></span><i> </i><span class="fontstyle21" style="font-family:Fd11243-Identity-H,serif"><span style="color:black"><span style="font-weight:normal"><span style="font-style:normal"><i><span style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="line-height:115%"><span style="font-family:&quot;Bookman Old Style&quot;,serif"><span style="color:black">to include:</span></span></span></span></i></span></span></span></span></span></p>

