				<p class="CxSpFirst" style="margin-left:-2px; text-align:justify"><span style="line-height:115%"><span class="fontstyle21" style="font-family:Fd11243-Identity-H,serif"><span style="color:black"><span style="font-weight:normal"><span style="font-style:normal"><i><span lang="IN" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="line-height:115%"><span style="font-family:&quot;Bookman Old Style&quot;,serif"><span style="color:black">provided </span></span></span></span></i></span></span></span></span><span class="fontstyle21" style="font-family:Fd11243-Identity-H,serif"><span style="color:black"><span style="font-weight:normal"><span style="font-style:normal"><i><span style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="line-height:115%"><span style="font-family:&quot;Bookman Old Style&quot;,serif"><span style="color:black">that such activity or, in the case of subparagraph c)</span></span></span></span></i></span></span></span></span><span class="fontstyle01" style="font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif"><span style="color:black"><span style="font-weight:normal"><span style="font-style:normal"><i><span style="font-family:&quot;Bookman Old Style&quot;,serif"><span style="color:black">, </span></span></i></span></span></span></span><span class="fontstyle21" style="font-family:Fd11243-Identity-H,serif"><span style="color:black"><span style="font-weight:normal"><span style="font-style:normal"><i><span style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="line-height:115%"><span style="font-family:&quot;Bookman Old Style&quot;,serif"><span style="color:black">the overall activity of the fixed place of</span></span></span></span></i></span></span></span></span><i> </i><span class="fontstyle21" style="font-family:Fd11243-Identity-H,serif"><span style="color:black"><span style="font-weight:normal"><span style="font-style:normal"><i><span style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="line-height:115%"><span style="font-family:&quot;Bookman Old Style&quot;,serif"><span style="color:black">business, is of a preparatory or auxiliary character.</span></span></span></span></i></span></span></span></span></span></p>

