			<div>
			<p class="CxSpFirst" style="text-align:justify"><span style="line-height:115%"><span class="fontstyle01" style="font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif"><span style="color:black"><span style="font-weight:normal"><span style="font-style:normal"><i><span style="font-family:&quot;Bookman Old Style&quot;,serif"><span style="color:black">The following</span></span></i></span></span></span></span><span class="fontstyle01" style="font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif"><span style="color:black"><span style="font-weight:normal"><span style="font-style:normal"><i><span lang="IN" style="font-family:&quot;Bookman Old Style&quot;,serif"><span style="color:black"> first sentence of</span></span></i></span></span></span></span><span class="fontstyle01" style="font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif"><span style="color:black"><span style="font-weight:normal"><span style="font-style:normal"><i><span style="font-family:&quot;Bookman Old Style&quot;,serif"><span style="color:black"> paragraph 3 of Article 16 of the MLI</span></span></i></span></span></span></span><span class="fontstyle01" style="font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif"><span style="color:black"><span style="font-weight:normal"><span style="font-style:normal"><i><span lang="IN" style="font-family:&quot;Bookman Old Style&quot;,serif"><span style="color:black"> applies to</span></span></i></span></span></span></span><span class="fontstyle01" style="font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif"><span style="color:black"><span style="font-weight:normal"><span style="font-style:normal"><i> </i></span></span></span></span><span class="fontstyle01" style="font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif"><span style="color:black"><span style="font-weight:normal"><span style="font-style:normal"><i><span style="font-family:&quot;Bookman Old Style&quot;,serif"><span style="color:black">paragraph 3 of Article 2</span></span></i></span></span></span></span><span class="fontstyle01" style="font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif"><span style="color:black"><span style="font-weight:normal"><span style="font-style:normal"><span style="font-family:&quot;Bookman Old Style&quot;,serif">5</span></span></span></span></span><span class="fontstyle01" style="font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif"><span style="color:black"><span style="font-weight:normal"><span style="font-style:normal"><i><span style="font-family:&quot;Bookman Old Style&quot;,serif"><span style="color:black"> of this </span></span></i></span></span></span></span><span class="fontstyle01" style="font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif"><span style="color:black"><span style="font-weight:normal"><span style="font-style:normal"><i><span lang="IN" style="font-family:&quot;Bookman Old Style&quot;,serif"><span style="color:black">Agreement</span></span></i></span></span></span></span><span class="fontstyle01" style="font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif"><span style="color:black"><span style="font-weight:normal"><span style="font-style:normal"><i><span style="font-family:&quot;Bookman Old Style&quot;,serif"><span style="color:black">:</span></span></i></span></span></span></span></span></p>

			<p class="CxSpMiddle" style="text-align:justify">&nbsp;</p>

			<p align="center" class="CxSpMiddle" style="text-align:center"><span style="line-height:115%"><i><span style="font-family:&quot;Bookman Old Style&quot;,serif"><span style="color:black">ARTICLE 16 OF THE MLI </span></span></i><i><span style="font-family:&quot;Bookman Old Style&quot;,serif"><span style="color:black">–</span></span></i><i><span style="font-family:&quot;Bookman Old Style&quot;,serif"><span style="color:black"> MUTUAL AGREEMENT PROCEDURE</span></span></i></span></p>

			<p class="CxSpMiddle">&nbsp;</p>

			<p style="text-align:justify; margin-bottom:11px"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:107%"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><i><span style="font-family:&quot;Bookman Old Style&quot;,serif"><span style="color:black">The competent authorities of the <span class="fontstyle01" style="font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif"><span style="color:black"><span style="font-weight:normal"><span style="font-style:normal"><i><span style="font-family:&quot;Bookman Old Style&quot;,serif"><span style="color:black">Contracting State</span></span></i></span></span></span></span></span></span></i><span class="fontstyle01" style="font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif"><span style="color:black"><span style="font-weight:normal"><span style="font-style:normal"><i><span lang="IN" style="font-family:&quot;Bookman Old Style&quot;,serif"><span style="color:black">s</span></span></i></span></span></span></span><span class="fontstyle21" style="font-family:Fd11243-Identity-H,serif"><span style="color:black"><span style="font-weight:normal"><span style="font-style:normal"><i><span style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="line-height:107%"><span style="font-family:&quot;Bookman Old Style&quot;,serif"><span style="color:black"> shall endeavour to resolve by mutual agreement any difficulties or doubts as to the interpretation or application of</span></span></span></span></i></span></span></span></span><i><span style="font-family:&quot;Bookman Old Style&quot;,serif"><span style="color:black"> <span class="fontstyle01" style="font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif"><span style="color:black"><span style="font-weight:normal"><span style="font-style:normal"><i><span style="font-family:&quot;Bookman Old Style&quot;,serif"><span style="color:black">the </span></span></i></span></span></span></span></span></span></i><span class="fontstyle01" style="font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif"><span style="color:black"><span style="font-weight:normal"><span style="font-style:normal"><i><span lang="IN" style="font-family:&quot;Bookman Old Style&quot;,serif"><span style="color:black">Agreement</span></span></i></span></span></span></span><i><span style="font-family:&quot;Bookman Old Style&quot;,serif"><span style="color:black">.</span></span></i></span></span></span></p>

			<p style="margin-bottom:11px">&nbsp;</p>
			</div>
