<p>&nbsp;</p>

<p style="text-align:justify; margin-bottom:11px"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:115%"><span style="text-autospace:none"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><b><span style="font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif">4. </span></b><b><i><span lang="IN" style="font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif"><span style="color:black">[MODIFIED by second sentence of paragraph 3 of Article 16 of the MLI] </span></span></i></b><i><span style="font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif"><span style="color:black">[The competent authorities of the Contracting States may communicate with each other directly for the purpose of giving effect to the provisions of this Agreement.]</span></span></i></span></span></span></span></p>

