" style="position:absolute; left:0; text-align:left; margin-left:5px; margin-top:7px; width:434.85pt; height:242.05pt; z-index:-251658231; v-text-anchor:top" type="#_x0000_t202"> <v:textbox> </v:textbox></v:shape></span></span></span></span></p>

